(vector (map (:adr/authoritative_for (vector "browser.css (cascade) + wasm-ui's kotoba.wasm.layout (draw-ops projection) merge into new repo kotoba-lang/cssom as cssom.core + cssom.layout" "browser.html moves to new repo kotoba-lang/htmldom as htmldom.core" "browser.compat.quickjs-binary (the only quickjs.* namespace with zero coupling to browser's own domain model) moves to new repo kotoba-lang/quickjs as quickjs.binary; the other three quickjs.* namespaces (quickjs/-binding/-execution) stay in browser, documented coupling reason in quickjs's own README" "kotoba-lang/cssom and kotoba-lang/htmldom are new names, not renames of the org's pre-existing unrelated css/html repos (EDN-as-markup Hiccup renderers, opposite direction)" "fixed the two-function compile blocker (kotoba.wasm.dom/insert-before + remove-child missing in wasm-ui) that had prevented browser's entire JVM test suite from ever compiling" "corrects a wrong ADR-number citation (ADR-2607041700) baked into several repos' README/docstrings/manifest comments during the work before this document existed under its real number; 2607041700 was already claimed by an unrelated cloud-itonami ADR" "same-session follow-up: cssom's feat/box-model-flex-layout (PR #1) replaces the reference vertical-stack cssom.layout with real box-model/flexbox/position/opacity/scroll/form-control layout, fixing all 75 failures + 1 error (+ 2 more in test-browser-use) that the compile-blocker fix above had exposed; wasm-ui's golden-test fixture regenerated to match")), (:adr/supersedes (vector)), (:adr/superseded_by (vector)), (:adr/topic "browser-css-html-quickjs-split"), (:adr/related (vector "adr-2607010930" "adr-2607050900" "adr-2607050700")), (:adr/status "accepted"), (:adr/id "adr-2607051140-browser-css-html-quickjs-split"), (:adr/doc_type "adr"), (:adr/last_verified "2026-07-04"), (:adr/body "# ADR-2607051140: kotoba-lang/browser split — cssom, htmldom, quickjs\n\n**Status**: accepted (implemented)\n**Date**: 2026-07-04 (session-numbered; see repos.edn ADR numbering convention)\n**Deciders**: Jun Kawasaki\n\nSee the companion .md file in this same directory for the full context,\ndecision, consequences, and follow-up sections (identical body, kept in\nsync)."), (:adr/deciders (vector "Jun Kawasaki")), (:adr/artifacts "{:cssom \"kotoba-lang/cssom @ 713aeae23bfebc242989fec0be6a51ba04676678 (PR #1: real box-model+flexbox layout; 7 tests/19 assertions, JVM)\", :htmldom \"kotoba-lang/htmldom (new) @ fa7e45e8836b8d3c4bda1ff56e4f888080440c6d (4 tests/9 assertions, JVM)\", :quickjs \"kotoba-lang/quickjs (new) @ 97815ba83bac9ec81f850aa6a986626edbb87b4a (3 tests/9 assertions, JVM)\", :wasm-ui \"kotoba-lang/wasm-ui @ fc5ffc456e720118f5a734c9eddee828533c0586 (dom.cljc insert-before/remove-child fix PR #2; layout.cljc -> cssom PR #3; golden fixture regen; 28 tests/97 assertions, 0 failures)\", :browser \"kotoba-lang/browser @ a7dc79695fd1a70011576d93681cc6f53f6f3232 (PR #2; 438 tests/2486 assertions, 0 failures/0 errors -- was 75 failures/1 errors before cssom's layout rewrite; test-browser-use 13 tests/112 assertions, 0 failures -- was 2)\"}"), (:adr/date "2026-07-04"), (:db/id -1), (:adr/authoritative true), (:adr/title "ADR-2607051140: kotoba-lang/browser split — cssom, htmldom, quickjs"), (:adr/source-format "edn")))